        "created_at": "2018-10-31T02:11:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm pretty sure you need to pay the 3 Energy before you do anything else from that box. I'm not sure why it matters, though: it's not like placing Presence would give you energy to help pay that cost. Other than that, I'm not sure.</p>",
