        "id": 223875,
        "name": "Eric R",
        "username": "Eric_R",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-31T03:08:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Choices (\"pick two\") are distinct from individual actions (\"Add a Presence at Range 3\"). You can make your choices in any order (when you have more than one), and within each choice you may perform the actions in any order, but you perform all actions in one choice before making another.</p>\n<p>https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.bu6od05</p>\n<p>https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.bu6od06</p>\n<p>When a choice has a cost, it must be paid <em>in order</em> to make that choice, before performing any actions therein.</p>",
