        "id": 223876,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-31T16:43:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What's handy about Keeper's chocies is you can start the turn with two Energy, use the Growth option that gives you another one, and then spend all three on the last Growth option - get out two Presence a turn every turn (except the first, obviously) as long as you ended the previous turn with at least two Energy! :D I think this might be part of the reason why Keeper is my <em>other</em> favourite spirit, because you can do All of the Things, roar smash stomp git orf moi laaaand!</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
