        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"dpt\"]\n\nI'm pretty sure you need to pay the 3 Energy before you do anything else from that box. I'm not sure why it matters, though: it's not like placing Presence would give you energy to help pay that cost. Other than that, I'm not sure.\n\n[/quote]\n\nTypically, I try to have Keeper end the turn with 2 Energy in hand, to take Ameena’s suggestion below. &nbsp;What I was hoping to have Keeper do is *first* use the 3 Range presence option to spread to a land without blight, second, add a second presence there, then gain the energy, then pay the three energy to gain the power card. &nbsp;\n\nAs I understand it from the comments above, though, I have to first add the presence to someplace I already have presence (or wilds), and gain 1 energy (Growth Option #3). &nbsp;Only then would&nbsp;I have enough energy for Growth Option #4.\n\nWhat if (for some reason) it’s super-important for me to instantly plonk down a sacred site somewhere far away? &nbsp;Could I do Growth Option #4 first, forgo drawing the power card (since I don’t have the energy to pay for it) and just put down a Presence at 3 Range, then use Growth Option #3 to add a Presence and gain 1 Energy?\n",
