      {
        "id": 223878,
        "name": "Eric R",
        "username": "Eric_R",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-01T00:29:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"robb8888\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> robb8888:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What if (for some reason) it’s super-important for me to instantly plonk down a sacred site somewhere far away? &nbsp;Could I do Growth Option <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#4</span> first, forgo drawing the power card (since I don’t have the energy to pay for it) and just put down a Presence at 3 Range, then use Growth Option <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#3</span> to add a Presence and gain 1 Energy?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nope. The cost is associated with the entire choice-group, not just the “Gain a Power Card” action; you must pay it up-front before taking any action in that choice.</p>",
